                                                "example_id": "1d861a74-2c70-4e98-8b81-955146789ecb",
                                                "sense_id": "97a3f484-82ee-3d52-8117-c7ea1c444146",
                                                "text": "Another disadvantageous feature of the Perth yard, again dictated by the considerations of the site, is that the six double-ended reception roads are alongside the sorting sidings and not laid end-to-end with them."
